date-released: "2026-10-01"
keywords:
  - world models
  - recurrent state-space model
  - model-based reinforcement learning
  - rollout error accumulation
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch PyTorch implementation of a recurrent state-space world model
  (RSSM) and a controlled empirical study of open-loop rollout error
  accumulation on Pendulum-v1. This is a reimplementation and measurement
  study; it does not propose a new architecture or a new algorithm.